{
  "Answer": {
    "Title": "Fix Missing Ruby via CircleCI Ruby Orb",
    "Explanation": [
      "The job log shows `ruby: command not found` (exit 127) because the config never installs Ruby before running `ruby -v`. The orbs block is empty and there is no install step, so no installation was attempted. The requirement explicitly says to use the Ruby Orb, so the fix is to add `ruby: circleci/ruby@\u003cversion\u003e` under `orbs:` and add a `- ruby/install:` step with `version: 2.6.3` before `ruby -v`."
    ],
