{
  "Answer": {
    "Title": "Add store_test_results and store_artifacts steps",
    "Explanation": [
      "The run step writes the JUnit XML file (the log confirms 'Wrote ~/project/results/test_results.xml'), so results were produced. However the step then runs 'exit 1', so the job fails and is not green. Even if the exit 1 were removed, the config has no store_test_results step (needed to populate the Test Summary tab) and no store_artifacts step (needed to expose the file as a downloadable artifact). Both are missing. The correct fix is to add a store_test_results step pointing at ~/project/results and a store_artifacts step pointing at ~/project/results (and drop the spurious exit 1 so the job passes). Neither store_artifacts alone nor store_test_results alone satisfies both parts of the requirement, 'set_upload_true' is not a valid CircleCI option, and only removing exit 1 would not surface the results anywhere."
